      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.28 (vs ₹0.81 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.28 (up from ₹0.81 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹99.5m (up 359% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.99m (up ₹11.7m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.0% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 27% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 40% per year, which means it is performing significantly worse than earnings.",
